  "input": {
    "structured_en": "[Span arrangement] Single simply supported span of 40 m (centre-to-centre of bearings); deck width 10 m.\n[Section and material] Precast prestressed T girders, 4 per span; middle-girder section at midspan: depth 2.5 m; precast flange 1.80 m wide, 0.18 m thick over the outer 0.20 m and thickening linearly to 0.27 m at the web; web 0.20 m thick; bottom bulb 0.60 m wide with a 0.35 m vertical part and a 0.20 m high linear transition to the web; girder concrete C50. Consider the self-weight of the main girders only (no wet joints, diaphragms, pavement or barriers).\n[Bearings and boundary] Abutments at both ends. Abutment 0: spherical bearings GQZ2000 (JT/T 854-2013, vertical design capacity 2000 kN), one under each girder end, longitudinally movable (types SX/DX). Abutment 1: spherical bearings GQZ2000 (JT/T 854-2013, vertical design capacity 2000 kN), one under each girder end, longitudinally fixed (fixed type GD at middle girders, transversely movable type DX at edge girders).\n[Design standard] Highway Class I loading (JTG D60-2015); two-way traffic, carriageway width 9 m, two design lanes.",
    "structured_zh": "【跨径布置】单跨简支，计算跨径 40 m（支座中心线间距）；桥面全宽 10 m。\n【截面与材料】预制预应力混凝土 T 梁，每跨 4 片；中梁跨中截面：梁高 2.5 m；预制翼缘宽 1.80 m，外侧 0.20 m 范围厚 0.18 m，向腹板线性增厚至 0.27 m；腹板厚 0.20 m；马蹄宽 0.60 m，竖直段高 0.35 m，经 0.20 m 高线性过渡段接腹板；主梁混凝土 C50。只计主梁自重（不计湿接缝、横隔板、铺装与护栏）。\n【支座与边界】两端为桥台。0 号台：球形支座 GQZ2000（JT/T 854-2013，竖向设计承载力 2000 kN），每个梁端 1 个，纵桥向活动（SX/DX 型）。1 号台：球形支座 GQZ2000（JT/T 854-2013，竖向设计承载力 2000 kN），每个梁端 1 个，纵桥向固定（中梁为固定支座 GD，边梁为横桥向单向活动支座 DX）。\n【设计标准】公路-I 级（JTG D60-2015）；双向行驶，行车道宽 9 m，设计车道数 2。"
  },
